Usage: copilot plugin marketplace list [OPTIONS]

List registered marketplaces.

Shows all marketplaces currently registered, including the default marketplaces
included with GitHub Copilot.

Options:
      --json
          Output as JSON

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

Examples:
  # List all registered marketplaces
  $ copilot plugin marketplace list

  # Machine-readable output
  $ copilot plugin marketplace list --json

Learn More:
  Use `copilot <command> --help` for more information about a command.
  Read the documentation at https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/copilot-cli
